0..47 Comment "//! A rule term can bind a variable in a field."
48..51 Comment "//!"
52..128 Comment "//! A `pi+ (x : S) . T` port accepts `bind x . t`. Substitution instantiates"
129..150 Comment "//! the variable `x`."
151..154 Comment "//!"
155..223 Comment "//! A `bind (a : N) . T` port abstracts atom `a`. A swap renames it."
224..300 Comment "//! A `Theory` value stores fields as `Bind` nodes and abstractions as `Abs`"
301..356 Comment "//! nodes. A program distinguishes the nodes by `case`."
357..360 Comment "//!"
361..462 Comment "//! - cites: [Kaposi-2024-secondorder_generalised_algebraic_theories_signatures_firstorder_semantics]"
463..466 Comment "//!"
